<title>FRANCE: EU raises daily wheat flour refund.</title>
<headline>EU raises daily wheat flour refund.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday raised to nine Ecus per tonne from a previous level of seven Ecus the refund on daily exports of soft wheat flour, France's grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>The EU also set at nine Ecus per tonne the refund applying to daily exports of durum wheat semolina, it said.  </p>
<p>The EU also set at 30 Ecus per tonne the refund applying to daily exports of rye flour.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
